        "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/5a136f8092ecf88765c3f6996b5fc2bc.avif?t=1763459707\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><br>Nazizombies Slayer is a hardcore top-down pixel shooter. Complete guild tasks, buy equipment, kill your enemies, solve level challenges, follow the development of the plot and enjoy the gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/ed86163d4e229fdb817957b7a96aa0a1.poster.avif?t=1763459707\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/ed86163d4e229fdb817957b7a96aa0a1.webm?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/ed86163d4e229fdb817957b7a96aa0a1.mp4?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/b7836840e4dee7dc22fdffaa91132211.avif?t=1763459707\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Stealth. Move slowly behind enemies' backs to avoid making noise and being seen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/c3c77207a3c45bb15fde35f571b1df11.poster.avif?t=1763459707\" width=600 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/c3c77207a3c45bb15fde35f571b1df11.webm?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/c3c77207a3c45bb15fde35f571b1df11.mp4?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Use mines and grenades to freeze enemies, poison them, or deal damage. Combine them to get new effects and new abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/f905878192b266f3b5a3f877c2c94c5f.poster.avif?t=1763459707\" width=600 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/f905878192b266f3b5a3f877c2c94c5f.webm?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/f905878192b266f3b5a3f877c2c94c5f.mp4?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Change and upgrade your costumes to increase your stats.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/386df422a0169c2700d7a5160b113543.poster.avif?t=1763459707\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/386df422a0169c2700d7a5160b113543.webm?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/386df422a0169c2700d7a5160b113543.mp4?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Increase your capital. Trade items found in levels at the bar.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/ff9d3b35cbd5b8a814764ae77b9fda04.poster.avif?t=1763459707\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/ff9d3b35cbd5b8a814764ae77b9fda04.webm?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/ff9d3b35cbd5b8a814764ae77b9fda04.mp4?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Find secrets in the levels and solve simple puzzles.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/f119c253cbacec573865ba8d72fa6af5.avif?t=1763459707\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>The state of Zeichland declares war and starts fighting against the whole world. This is a terrible and uncomplicated situation for all mankind, but not for mercenaries, who see it only as an opportunity to earn money. The story is told on behalf of a mysterious mercenary from Big Earth, who arrived in Lower Zeich and settled in the newly opened branch of the Lanor Guild. You will have to fulfill the guild's tasks and follow the consequences of what is happening.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/4725ebae86a163b39d3dbf77da5bab8c.poster.avif?t=1763459707\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/4725ebae86a163b39d3dbf77da5bab8c.webm?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/4725ebae86a163b39d3dbf77da5bab8c.mp4?t=1763459707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
